     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Phil and all,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for a great R tool! I have a very, very basic question to make sure my understanding of my output is correct. I ran a 3 specific, 1 general factor bifactor model:</div><div><br></div><div><div>MODEL2 &lt;- c(1,2,2,3,1,2,3,2,2,3,2,1,1,1,1,3,3)</div><div>BiFactor &lt;- bfactor(Bifactor, MODEL2, itemtype=&quot;graded&quot;, SE=TRUE, TOL=.0001, technical=list(NCYCLES=20000, BURNIN=1500, SEMCYCLES=500, removeEmptyRows=TRUE))</div></div><div><br></div><div>The model ran with good fit, and the factors from summary(BiFactor) were labeled &quot;G,&quot; &quot;S1,&quot; &quot;S2,&quot; and &quot;S3.&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>&gt;summary(BiFactor)</div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"384\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:288pt\">\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"64\" span=\"6\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" width=\"64\" style=\"height:14.4pt;width:48pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n  <div>G </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">  S1 </td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">  S2 </td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">  S3 </td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">  h2</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>s1 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.695</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.532</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.767</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>f1 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.198</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.788</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.66</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>f2 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.299</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.771</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.684</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>e1</div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">-0.218</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.903</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.863</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>s2 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.919</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.35</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.968</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>f3 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.214</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.871</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.804</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>e3</div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">-0.193</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.858</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.774</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>f4 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.195</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.87</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.795</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <div>f5 </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0.155</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0<