     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Dev,<div><br></div><div>This I somewhat silly labeling on my part, but the values F1 through F4 correspond exactly to the G, S1 through S3. In other words, they match the columns you find in the summary() output. I should probably include the actual names in the factor variable output, but I&#39;ve mainly left them as F1, F2.... for historical reasons (might be a good time for a change, though). Cheers.</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
